cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
title: "Scholar Schema: a structured academic publishing system"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ch'ng"
    given-names: "Ewe Seng"
    affiliation: "Universiti Sains Malaysia"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >-
  A structured academic publishing system for microjournals, journal club
  records and other structured academic writing. A base schema holds the
  fields every article shares; each article schema builds on it and adds
  type-specific fields. Articles are built into web pages, PDFs and issues.
  Designed and specified by the author; implemented with AI-assisted
  programming under the author's direction.
keywords:
  - microjournal
  - journal club
  - structured academic writing
  - schema-driven publishing
  - Jekyll
  - GitHub Pages
  - Zenodo
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/es-chng/scholar-schema"
url: "https://es-chng.github.io/scholar-schema/"
